# Allow-list for `docker build -f src/Daedalus.Sandbox/Dockerfile .` from the repository root: exclude everything, then
# allow exactly what the build stage copies. Directory.Build.props imports nothing else; .editorconfig is read by the
# analyzers (EnforceCodeStyleInBuild), so the build stage needs it.
*
!Directory.Build.props
!Directory.Packages.props
!nuget.config
# TEMPORARY: the vendored Minos.NET folder nuget.config names, until nuget.org lists 1.0.1.
!vendor/nuget/
!.editorconfig
!src/Daedalus.Sandbox/
**/bin/
**/obj/
